  "ruleText": "CHAPTER He-W 700 He-W 700 SUPPLEMENTAL NUTRITION ASSISTANCE PROGRAM (SNAP)\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 161:4-A, IV\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #5133, effective 7-22-91, replaced all former rules of Chapter He-W 700. All prior filings for the sections in this chapter have expired. The filings prior to Document #5133 include the following documents:\n\n2398, eff 6-30-83 | 2454, eff 8-30-83 | 2460, eff 8-31-83\n\n2481(E), eff 8-31-83 | 2491, eff 10-1-83 | 2527(E), eff 10-21-83\n\n2547(E), eff 12-2-83 | 2592, eff 1-20-84 | 2692, eff 4-24-84\n\n2693, eff 4-24-84 | 2726, eff 5-24-84 | 2750, eff 6-14-84\n\n2997, eff 3-27-85 | 3014, eff 5-8-85 | 3041, eff 6-26-85\n\n3152(E), eff 11-20-85 | 3182, eff 1-22-86 | 4047(E), eff 4-30-86\n\n4165, eff 11-6-86 | 4246, eff 3-30-87 | 4319, eff 10-1-87\n\n4333, eff 10-27-87 | 4464, eff 8-3-88 | 4465, eff 8-3-88",
